<<
/Title (.  As I walked home without my brother, I couldn't help but feel like the biggest dumbass to ever walk the Earth. She was perfect in every way I could describe, of course she wanted Ryan. He had blonde hair, and shiny green eyes, and I was just an average white guy, with dusty brown hair and icy blue eyes. Not only that, I heard that he had taken a blast of darkness for her during the Battle of Nevaeh two years ago, I could never have been that brave. Ryan has it all, he gets good grades, he has so many girls foaming at the mouth over him, yet all he sees is her.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
